## 7. KEY FILES & PATTERNS

### API Endpoints (Cloudflare Pages Functions)
```
functions/api/
├── _shared/
│   ├── auth.ts              # authenticateRequest(), handleCorsOptions
│   ├── prisma-edge.ts       # createEdgePrismaClient()
│   └── types.ts             # CloudflareEnv interface
├── conditions/
│   └── pearls.ts            # GET/POST pearl management
├── drills/
│   └── submit-review.ts     # POST review submission + FSRS update
├── questions/
│   ├── session.ts           # GET session questions with interleaving
│   └── pool.ts              # GET/POST question pool management
├── user/
│   ├── analytics.ts         # GET user performance stats
│   └── stability-trend.ts   # GET stability growth data
└── geminiProxy.ts           # POST streaming AI proxy
```

### Services (Business Logic)
```
services/
├── conditionDataLoader.ts        # Database-first content loading
├── mainSessionService.ts         # Client-side session orchestration
├── questionService.ts            # Question fetching with pool management
├── geminiService.ts              # AI question generation
└── buzzwordService.ts            # Rapid recall buzzword management
```

### Core Libraries
```
lib/
├── fsrs.ts                       # FSRS v5 algorithm implementation
└── services/
    ├── userProgressService.ts    # UserProgress CRUD + history
    ├── srsService.ts             # SRS item management (localStorage)
    └── semanticValidationService.ts  # Answer validation
```

### Database Schema
```
prisma/schema.prisma
Key Models:
- User                    # Clerk-synced users
- MedicalContent          # Conditions with JSONB content
- UserProgress            # FSRS state + reviewHistory[]
- MediaAsset              # Supabase-stored images
- MedicalContentMedia     # Junction: content ↔ media
- QuestionAttempt         # Answer tracking
- SRSItem                 # Legacy SRS (being phased out)
```

